33; Joh 19:1 1Pe 2:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-16","title":"Mark 15:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the soldiers. Mt 27:27 Praetorium.[Praitorion ,] in Latin, {praetorium,} was properly the tent or house of the {praetor,} a military, and sometimes a civil officer.</p>\n<p>Joh 18:28; 19:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-17","title":"Mark 15:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Mt 27:28-30; Lu 23:11; Joh 19:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-18","title":"Mark 15:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Hail. 29-32; Ge 37:10,20; Mt 27:42,43; Lu 23:36,37; Joh 19:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-19","title":"Mark 15:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>they smote. 9:12; 10:34; 14:65; Job 13:9; 30:8-12; Ps 22:6,7; 35:15-17 Ps 69:12,19,20; Isa 49:7; 50:6; 52:14; 53:3-5; Mic 5:1; Mt 20:18,19 Lu 18:32,33; 22:63; 23:11,36; Heb 12:2,3; 13:13 and bowing. Ge 24:52; 43:28; 1Ki 19:18; Es 3:2-5; Isa 45:23; Ro 11:4; 14:10,11 Php 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-20","title":"Mark 15:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>and led. Mt 27:31; Joh 19:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-21","title":"Mark 15:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>they compel. Mt 27:32; Lu 23:26 a Cyrenian. Ac 2:10; 6:9; 11:20; 13:1 and Rufus. Ro 16:13 to bear. Lu 14:27; Joh 15:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-22","title":"Mark 15:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Golgotha. Mt 27:33-44; Lu 23:27-33 Calvary. Joh 19:17-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-23","title":"Mark 15:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>they. Mt 27:34; Lu 23:36; Joh 19:28-30 but. 14:25; Mt 26:19; Lu 22:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-24","title":"Mark 15:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>crucified. De 21:23; Ps 22:16,17; Isa 53:4-8; Ac 5:30; 2Co 5:21; Ga 3:13 1Pe 2:24 they parted. Ps 22:18; Mt 27:35,36; Lu 23:34; Joh 19:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-25","title":"Mark 15:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the. 33; Mt 27:45; Lu 23:44; Joh 19:14; Ac 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-26","title":"Mark 15:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the superscription. De 23:5; Ps 76:10; Pr 21:1; Isa 10:7; 46:10 THE KING OF THE JEWS. Ps 2:6; Zec 9:9; Mt 2:2; 27:37; Lu 23:37,38; Joh 19:18-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-27","title":"Mark 15:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Mt 27:38; Lu 23:32,33; Joh 19:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-28","title":"Mark 15:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Isa 53:12; Lu 22:37; Heb 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-29","title":"Mark 15:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>they. Ps 22:7,8,12-14; 35:15-21; 69:7,19,20,26; 109:25; La 1:12; 2:15 Mt 27:39,40 Ah. 14:58; Ge 37:19,20; Mt 26:61; Joh 2:18-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-31","title":"Mark 15:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>also. Ps 2:1-4; 22:16,17; Mt 27:41-43; Lu 23:35-37 He. Joh 11:47-52; 12:23,24; 1Pe 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-32","title":"Mark 15:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>Christ. 14:61,62; Isa 44:6; Zep 3:15; Zec 9:9; Joh 1:49; 12:13; 19:12-15 Joh 20:25-29 that. Ro 3:3; 2Ti 2:18 And. Mt 27:44; Lu 23:39-43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-33","title":"Mark 15:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>when. 25; Mt 27:45; Lu 23:44,45 darkness. Ps 105:28; Isa 50:3,4; Am 8:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-34","title":"Mark 15:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>at. Da 9:21; Lu 23:46; Ac 10:3 Eloi. Ps 22:1; Mt 27:46; Heb 5:7 why. Ps 27:9; 42:9; 71:11; Isa 41:17; La 1:12; 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-35","title":"Mark 15:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>he. 9:11-13; Mt 17:11-13; 27:47-49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-36","title":"Mark 15:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>23; Ps 69:21; Lu 23:36; Joh 19:28-30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-37","title":"Mark 15:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>Mt 27:50; Lu 23:46; Joh 19:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-38","title":"Mark 15:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Ex 26:31-34; 40:20,21; Le 16:2-19; 2Ch 3:8-14; Mt 27:51-53 Lu 23:45; Heb 4:14-16; 6:19; 9:3-12; 10:19-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-39","title":"Mark 15:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>the centurion.The centurion was a military captain, and commander of a century, or 100 men. In order to have a proper notion of his office, it may be desirable to explain the construction and array of the Roman legion. Each legion was divided into ten cohorts, each cohort into three maniples, and each maniple into two centuries; so that there were thirty maniples, and sixty centuries in a legion, which, if the century had always, as the word imports, consisted of 100 soldiers, would have formed a combined phalanx of 6,000 men. The number in a legion, however, varied at different periods; in the time of Polybius it was 4,200. The order of battle was that of three lines; the hastati, or spearmen, occupied the front; the principes, the second line; the {triarii,} (also called {pilani,} from their weapon, the {pilam,}) the third. The centurions were appointed by the tribunes, and generally selected from the common soldiers according to their merit; although the office was sometimes obtained for money, or through the favour of the consuls. Their badge was a vine rod, or sapling.</p>\n<p>44; Mt 8:5-10; Ac 10:1; 27:1-3,43 he said. Mt 27:43,54; Lu 23:47,48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-40","title":"Mark 15:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>women. Ps 38:11; Mt 27:55,56; Lu 23:49; Joh 19:25-27 Mary Magdalene. 16:9; Mt 28:1; Lu 8:2,3; Joh 20:11-18 Mary the. 47; 16:1; Mt 13:55; 27:55,61; Joh 19:25; 1Co 9:5; Ga 1:19; Jas 1:1 Salome. 16:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-41","title":"Mark 15:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>ministered. Mt 27:56; Lu 8:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-42","title":"Mark 15:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>Mt 27:57,62; Lu 23:50-54; Joh 19:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-43","title":"Mark 15:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>an. 10:23-27 which. Lu 2:25,38; 23:51 and went. 14:54,66-72; Mt 19:30; 20:16; Ac 4:8-13; Php 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-44","title":"Mark 15:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>Joh 19:31-37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-45","title":"Mark 15:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>he gave. Mt 27:58; Joh 19:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-46","title":"Mark 15:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>and took. Mt 27:59,60; Lu 23:53; Joh 19:38-42 and laid. Isa 53:9 hewn. Isa 22:16 and rolled. 16:3,4; Mt 27:60; 28:2; Joh 11:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-15-47","title":"Mark 15:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>40; 16:1; Mt 27:61; 28:1; Lu 23:55,56; 24:1,2</p>"}]}